  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;On the basis of evidence submitted and the balance of probabilities, the ground floor of the premises at Hos Cottage, 4, THE QUADRANT Headstone Gardens, Harrow, HA2 6PN has been in use as a hot food takeaway for a continuous period of at least 10 years prior to the date of this application. The use of the ground floor of the premises as a hot food takeaway is therefore immune from enforcement action under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) and is lawful under Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
